{
  "id": "foundryvtt-local-rest-api",
  "title": "Foundry Local REST API",
  "description": "<p>A local REST API for FoundryVTT v13 and v14. A companion Node.js bridge server, deployed separately, serves the HTTP endpoints and relays each request over Foundry's socket to this module, which answers from the logged-in Gamemaster's browser.</p><p><strong>Endpoints:</strong> actor, item and scene search and details, world information, dice rolls, compendium search and diagnostics (recent logs, log search, health).</p><p><strong>Security:</strong> API key authentication, role and document permission checks, input validation and sanitisation. Requests are read-only apart from dice rolls.</p>",
